{"t":"Sarcophagus","s":"sarcophagus-28d75","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Sarcophagus_2d97e3.gif","q":3,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><dl><dd><i>This page is about the <b>Sarcophagus</b> which is closed and can be opened. For the open sarcophagus, see Sarcophagus (Open), and for the one which cannot be opened, see <a href=\"#/wiki/Sarcophagus%20%28Quest%29\">Sarcophagus (Quest)</a>.</i></dd></dl>\n<div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Sarcophagus</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Sarcophagus\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sarcophagus_2d97e3.gif\" width=\"64\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Containers\">Containers</a><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Coffins\">Coffins</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"immobile\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Movable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"mapcolor\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Map Color</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"colorbox\" style=\"background-color: #ff3300; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: inline-block;\"></span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Utility Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"volume\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Volume</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"usable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7.3<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">August 11, 2004</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20070124030055&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sarcophagus_2d97e3.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a sarcophagus <span class=\"p-attributes\">(Vol:6)</span>.<div class=\"p-weight\"></div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>These can be found in <a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun\">Ankrahmun</a> in the Great Pyramid, in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun%20Tombs\">tombs</a>, in <a href=\"#/wiki/Drefia\">Drefia</a>, and in <a href=\"#/wiki/Hellgorge\">Hellgorge</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>A sarcophagus's purpose is to contain a dead body, like a <a href=\"#/wiki/Coffins\">coffin</a>. The <a href=\"#/wiki/Pharaohs\">pharaohs</a>, of course, being <a href=\"#/wiki/Creatures\">undead</a> refuse to stay in them. Any items placed inside a sarcophagus will be deleted on the next <a href=\"#/wiki/Floor%20Reset\">Floor Reset</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Coffins\">Coffins</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Containers\">Containers</a></li><li>Duplicate Sprites</li><li>Rookgaard Graveyards</li><li>Sarcophagus (Open)</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Sarcophagus%20%28Quest%29\">Sarcophagus (Quest)</a></li><li>Sarcophagus (Wall)</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/shadows-of-yalahar-quest\">Shadows of Yalahar Quest</a></li><li>Svargrond Libraries</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/the-ancient-tombs-quest\">The Ancient Tombs Quest</a></li><li>The Frostspire's Secret VII (Book)</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/the-rookie-guard-quest\">The Rookie Guard Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Yakchal\">Yakchal</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["shadows-of-yalahar-quest","the